#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=2022-02-11|author=Mateon1|title=Game of Life with real 8 neighbors|newsgroup=comp.theory.cell-automata|url=https://groups.google.com/g/comp.theory.cell-automata/c/7S3cmItKc9s/m/5g2NidtyBgAJ|text=I've seen this space colloquially referred to as MAP (presumably since it maps a 3x3 neighborhood into a future '''cell''' state)}}
