===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[enclose]] in a [[room]].
#: {{ux|en|She had '''chambered''' herself in her room, and wouldn't come out.}}
# To [[reside]] in or [[occupy]] a chamber or chambers.
